{% extends "eng/_layout.txt.j2" %}
{#- OCCLUSION_DETECTED - quality gate: part of the page is covered or falls outside the frame -#}
{% block subject %}Part of your document is covered and cannot be read{% endblock %}
{% block defect %}Something is covering part of the page — commonly a finger over an edge, a
shadow across the sheet, a note stuck on top, or the page running off the
side of the picture. The details of a complaint are often in exactly the
part that is covered.{% endblock %}
{% block remedy %}Please take anything resting on the page away, keep your fingers outside the
frame, and make sure the whole sheet including all four corners is visible.
Then scan or photograph it again at {{ recommended_dpi }} DPI in even light,
so that no shadow falls across the page.{% endblock %}
